WEBVTT

00:08:26.585 --> 00:08:30.839
To be on stage at the premiere conference
for the experts in their field,

00:08:30.839 --> 00:08:32.341
talking about twerking --

00:08:32.341 --> 00:08:33.759
(Laughter)

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:35.594
and stating my facts,

00:08:35.594 --> 00:08:36.845
makes me optimistic.

00:08:37.263 --> 00:08:41.308
The best thing I can do
is be loud and take ownership,

00:08:41.308 --> 00:08:42.768
because for me,

00:08:42.768 --> 00:08:44.603
twerking is a pearl of optimism.

00:08:45.229 --> 00:08:47.898
It’s a form of self-expression, freedom --

00:08:47.898 --> 00:08:49.233
confidence.

00:08:49.441 --> 00:08:51.569
Twerking is not
just something I do to music.

00:08:51.569 --> 00:08:53.153
It’s extremely useful.

00:08:53.571 --> 00:08:56.574
It manifests in my life
in ways that I need more joy.

00:08:56.574 --> 00:08:57.783
In the mornings,

00:08:57.783 --> 00:09:00.578
twerking leads me to stretching
and taking care of my body.